- Production Signatures: Galvanic Bio-Modulation (patching live electrode signals from plant leaves into analog synth filters and wah-pedal circuits); Condenser Greenhouse Tracking (placing full string and woodwind sections inside hyper-humid, glass-enclosed botanical conservatories for a dense, water-damped natural reverb); Tannin-Baked Tape Saturation (mastering onto magnetic tape stocks soaked in boiled tea and botanical tannins to achieve fluttery, decaying low-mid frequencies).
